## Booking

- [Book a consultation]({{ shop.url }}/pages/book)
- Same-day appointments are typically available for most services, subject to clinical appropriateness and capacity.
- Walk-ins welcome, subject to capacity. Pick a time online to guarantee a slot.
- No GP referral needed. A pharmacist assesses you directly.

## Regulation and governance

Longeva operates under UK pharmacy regulation:

- Registered pharmacy with the General Pharmaceutical Council ({{ gphc }})
- Complies with the MHRA/GPhC/ASA 2025 enforcement guidance on advertising prescription-only medicines
- Complaints procedure: {{ shop.url }}/policies/complaints-policy

